<item><title>Kenya&apos;s election commission will follow court rules on 2027 results</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/kenya-s-election-commission-will-follow-court-rules-on-2027-7781c7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/kenya-s-election-commission-will-follow-court-rules-on-2027-7781c7/</guid><category>Kenya</category><description>Chairperson Erastus Ethekon says the commission will tally and verify results collectively, while only he can declare the winner.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:27:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" length="31123" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mombasa port fire kills two as investigation begins</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/mombasa-port-fire-kills-two-as-investigation-begins-cf8b85/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/mombasa-port-fire-kills-two-as-investigation-begins-cf8b85/</guid><category>Kenya</category><description>The Kenya Ports Authority says a gas cylinder explosion ignited a kiosk fire outside the port on Monday, and crews stopped it spreading.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:20:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" length="31123" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Kenya plans 6.16 million fruit seedlings for 2027/28</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/kenya-plans-6-16-million-fruit-seedlings-for-2027-28-468519/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/kenya-plans-6-16-million-fruit-seedlings-for-2027-28-468519/</guid><category>Kenya</category><description>The draft budget policy includes date palms for growers in arid and semi-arid areas, alongside seedlings for eight other crops.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:19:47 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" length="31123" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
